  "title": "Risks and assumptions",
  "text": "The main risk to this proposal is exceeding the 20-page limit or missing the upload deadline due to network delays, which would result in rejection [RSK-001]. We would enforce an 18-page limit on the draft and upload the proposal 24 hours in advance [RSK-001]. A further risk is that prerequisite work packages take longer than expected and delay the spring enrollment go-live past 2027-01-11, breaching the contract [RSK-002]. We would prioritize core signing and REST API integration to meet the deadline, and de-scope non-mandatory features temporarily [RSK-002]. Additionally, it remains an open question whether specific format or schema details are available for the College's existing REST API mentioned in REQ-0008 [Q-01].",
